{"id":"6b55223e341a675a","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-kthreshold.md","title":"k-fold disjunction of threshold functions","display":"df-kthreshold — k-fold disjunction of threshold functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-kthreshold","aliases":["27-df-kthreshold"],"display":"df-kthreshold — k-fold disjunction of threshold functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolop]]","[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.2 Theorem 9.2; local disjunctive-threshold definition","source_printed_pages":"408","source_pdf_pages":"432","verification_status":"local-definition-book-background-checked-no-book-definition-located","source_relation":"local-definition-or-lemma-with-book-background","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-kthreshold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-kthreshold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kthreshold — k-fold disjunction of threshold functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Theorem 9.2; local disjunctive-threshold definition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"408"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"432"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-book-background-checked-no-book-definition-located"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"local-definition-or-lemma-with-book-background"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigvee\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a> 中已构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> 上有限析取；引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists(f_1,\\ldots,f_k)\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n^k\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\bigvee_{j=1}^k f_j(x)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists(f_1,\\ldots,f_k)\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n^k\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\bigvee_{j=1}^k f_j(x)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留本目录既有局部扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n\\)</span> 指至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个阈值函数的析取，允许重复与常 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 填充，故“恰好列出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个”不强制最小表示数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>已检索原书文本中的 “k-threshold” 及邻近 §9.1–§9.3，未定位到这一命名对应的书中定义；不将它标成原书定义，也不混同 §9.1 所述 polynomial threshold functions。相关书内背景仅为 Theorem 9.2（印刷 p.408／PDF p.432）的阈值门复合表示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bigvee$ 是 [[27-df-boolop]] 中已构造的 $\\mathbb B$ 上有限析取；引入 $\\mathrm{Threshold}^{(k)}_n$。","embed":